(5820735, 847137, 105130, '<td valign="top">I had to come back and comment on this photo. While I see that the technical aspects are all very well done (the lighting is fantastic), I don''t <i>understand</i> it. I think it would have worked much better without the man, who seems to me to be somewhat unnecessary, and not in keeping with the feel of the image. I''m very interested to read your comments after voting.</td>', 'I had to come back and comment on this photo. While I see that the technical aspects are all very well done (the lighting is fantastic), I don''t understand it. I think it would have worked much better without the man, who seems to me to be somewhat unnecessary, and not in keeping with the feel of the image. I''m very interested to read your comments after voting.', '2010-01-21 03:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5820738, 848006, 105130, '<td valign="top">While the wide angle is interesting, this is quite painful to look at - I think you may have over-sharpened it somewhat, and you could have pushed the leaf slightly more off-centre.</td>', 'While the wide angle is interesting, this is quite painful to look at - I think you may have over-sharpened it somewhat, and you could have pushed the leaf slightly more off-centre.', '2010-01-21 03:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
