(5820741, 848166, 105130, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but in what way is this delicate? Perhaps it''s an onslaught of fat and salt on your delicate heart? :-)</td>', 'Sorry, but in what way is this delicate? Perhaps it''s an onslaught of fat and salt on your delicate heart? :-)', '2010-01-21 03:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
