(5820743, 848047, 105130, '<td valign="top">The horizon isn''t straight, the colours are over saturated, you have pixellation issues at the top, something greenish on the left middle and an annoying shadow in the bottom right.</td>', 'The horizon isn''t straight, the colours are over saturated, you have pixellation issues at the top, something greenish on the left middle and an annoying shadow in the bottom right.', '2010-01-21 03:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
