(5821300, 847779, 57447, '<td valign="top">I like the main foreground but the background seems busy.</td>', 'I like the main foreground but the background seems busy.', '2010-01-21 13:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5821365, 847563, 28427, '<td valign="top">Never thought of it to make a photograph of an orchid in b&amp;w.  I always want to show their beautiful colours.  At first, when I saw this photograph, I hesitated.  But the more I look at it, the better I find it. You''ve managed to create a beautiful picture with almost - if not every - possible grey tone of the scale and with white and black present as well.<br/>So, with this, I''m reviewing my vote from 7 to 9.</td>', 'Never thought of it to make a photograph of an orchid in b&w.  I always want to show their beautiful colours.  At first, when I saw this photograph, I hesitated.  But the more I look at it, the better I find it. You''ve managed to create a beautiful picture with almost - if not every - possible grey tone of the scale and with white and black present as well.So, with this, I''m reviewing my vote from 7 to 9.', '2010-01-21 14:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5821373, 847387, 28427, '<td valign="top">I imagine this was not the first bulb you''ve shattered to obtain this photograph.  All parts are splendidly in focus and frozen - as it should be.</td>', 'I imagine this was not the first bulb you''ve shattered to obtain this photograph.  All parts are splendidly in focus and frozen - as it should be.', '2010-01-21 14:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5821378, 847297, 28427, '<td valign="top">You''ve chosen snow to put this already delicate flower on and this works perfectly.  The snow put on the rose itself, strengthens the delicate feeling even more.  Well done.</td>', 'You''ve chosen snow to put this already delicate flower on and this works perfectly.  The snow put on the rose itself, strengthens the delicate feeling even more.  Well done.', '2010-01-21 14:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5821381, 848166, 28427, '<td valign="top">Delicate? How it''s dressed on the plate? a delicate temptation for someone who''s on a diet? I''m awaiting to see the notes to see how this rimes whit the challenge.  I have to admit that at this moment I don''t see the point.  Sorry.</td>', 'Delicate? How it''s dressed on the plate? a delicate temptation for someone who''s on a diet? I''m awaiting to see the notes to see how this rimes whit the challenge.  I have to admit that at this moment I don''t see the point.  Sorry.', '2010-01-21 14:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5821390, 848216, 28427, '<td valign="top">Although I get the creeps of an eye shot that close and wide open this way, I vote in function of the technical aspects.  Sharp from left to right, bottom to top.  The skin in b&amp;w, the eye ball slightly coloured and the iris full colour: perfect job.</td>', 'Although I get the creeps of an eye shot that close and wide open this way, I vote in function of the technical aspects.  Sharp from left to right, bottom to top.  The skin in b&w, the eye ball slightly coloured and the iris full colour: perfect job.', '2010-01-21 14:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5821397, 848058, 28427, '<td valign="top">There are several photographs in this challenge worthy of a top place.  And this is one of them, for sure.  I would, without any hesitation, hang this up in my house.</td>', 'There are several photographs in this challenge worthy of a top place.  And this is one of them, for sure.  I would, without any hesitation, hang this up in my house.', '2010-01-21 14:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5821401, 848100, 71489, '<td valign="top">william88?<br/>irene?<br/>Anyways even if it''s not the above two names then it implies the image is super stellar!</td>', 'william88?irene?Anyways even if it''s not the above two names then it implies the image is super stellar!', '2010-01-21 15:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5821540, 848109, 17507, '<td valign="top">I can only imagine how many eggs you went through on this shoot.<br/> <br/>--<br/> <br/>Having now viewed all the images in this challenge, this is solidly in my top 3 and I''ll be surprised (and disappointed) if I don''t see it in the top 5. Really a great image, and a fabulous way to meet the challenge.</td>', 'I can only imagine how many eggs you went through on this shoot. -- Having now viewed all the images in this challenge, this is solidly in my top 3 and I''ll be surprised (and disappointed) if I don''t see it in the top 5. Really a great image, and a fabulous way to meet the challenge.', '2010-01-21 17:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5821541, 847081, 17507, '<td valign="top">I feel like we don''t see too many B/W macro bugs on DPC, so for a subject that''s become fairly cliche, the B/W is refreshing. Certainly the best of the bug shots, and in my top 3--hope to see this on (or at least near!) the front page when it all pans out.</td>', 'I feel like we don''t see too many B/W macro bugs on DPC, so for a subject that''s become fairly cliche, the B/W is refreshing. Certainly the best of the bug shots, and in my top 3--hope to see this on (or at least near!) the front page when it all pans out.', '2010-01-21 17:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5821543, 847106, 17507, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the many (many many!) baby shots in this challenge. The expression is priceless, and saves this image from the sappy sentimentality that many of the other baby pictures have.</td>', 'My favorite of the many (many many!) baby shots in this challenge. The expression is priceless, and saves this image from the sappy sentimentality that many of the other baby pictures have.', '2010-01-21 17:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
