(5824944, 847838, 111808, '<td valign="top">A miniature Camera Obscura view contained within the fragile drops. I love the pastellised pink softness and how it sets the drops out as the main subject immediately. The Greek Kaleidos=Beautiful, and it is.</td>', 'A miniature Camera Obscura view contained within the fragile drops. I love the pastellised pink softness and how it sets the drops out as the main subject immediately. The Greek Kaleidos=Beautiful, and it is.', '2010-01-22 20:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
