(5824970, 847461, 111808, '<td valign="top">He looks so tiny and yet so beautiful with the tones of his skin.</td>', 'He looks so tiny and yet so beautiful with the tones of his skin.', '2010-01-22 20:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
