(5824979, 848137, 111808, '<td valign="top">Yes, Life is indeed Delicate and Fragile and sometimes cruel as well.<br/>"Now is the Winter of our Discontent made Glorious Summer by this Sun", whom this poor bird shall see no more. Eloquent capture.</td>', 'Yes, Life is indeed Delicate and Fragile and sometimes cruel as well."Now is the Winter of our Discontent made Glorious Summer by this Sun", whom this poor bird shall see no more. Eloquent capture.', '2010-01-22 21:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5824981, 848147, 111808, '<td valign="top">Perhaps it is thin ice but the clear patterns in it are quite beautiful. They are not as random as would first be assumed as the water does freeze in precise patterns. These overlapping crackles are magnicently delicate as is the mound of fallen snowcap.</td>', 'Perhaps it is thin ice but the clear patterns in it are quite beautiful. They are not as random as would first be assumed as the water does freeze in precise patterns. These overlapping crackles are magnicently delicate as is the mound of fallen snowcap.', '2010-01-22 21:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5824990, 847656, 111808, '<td valign="top">It does indeed. Just because we think we know someone does not make it so and<br/>you are so correct - Human Beings are delicate in all sorts of ways not always apparent by our Masques.</td>', 'It does indeed. Just because we think we know someone does not make it so andyou are so correct - Human Beings are delicate in all sorts of ways not always apparent by our Masques.', '2010-01-22 21:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
