(5837876, 848137, 47541, '<td valign="top">Hi from the Critique Club<br/> <br/>I seem to get a few of your shots in this :)<br/> <br/>First impressions are that the shot is nice and crisp but a little awkward. The detail in the bird is great and the bits of ice on the bird are very thought provoking. It is clear the bird is dead and that will invoke some emotion in the viewer (not always good for your scores). It may be due to the ice being white that we lose some detail and thus a lot of understanding of the depth involved but it feels like you were walking along, saw the bird on the ground, and took a shot from above. This is what I meant earlier by "feels awkward". Somehow the POV and the centered composition combine to give that awkwardness.<br/> <br/>Overall it conveys the challenge theme well and probably deserved a slightly higher score on the tones and detail alone.</td>', 'Hi from the Critique Club I seem to get a few of your shots in this :) First impressions are that the shot is nice and crisp but a little awkward. The detail in the bird is great and the bits of ice on the bird are very thought provoking. It is clear the bird is dead and that will invoke some emotion in the viewer (not always good for your scores). It may be due to the ice being white that we lose some detail and thus a lot of understanding of the depth involved but it feels like you were walking along, saw the bird on the ground, and took a shot from above. This is what I meant earlier by "feels awkward". Somehow the POV and the centered composition combine to give that awkwardness. Overall it conveys the challenge theme well and probably deserved a slightly higher score on the tones and detail alone.', '2010-01-27 13:38:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(5837918, 848287, 61961, '<td valign="top">I love that you had only one commenter and your average commenter score is 6.0000.  So much for anonymous voting (I realize the commenter also told you what his vote would be).<br/> <br/>I thought you met the challenge theme well, by the way.  But you''re right, a 9 and a 10 is a bit high.  Is your mom voting?</td>', 'I love that you had only one commenter and your average commenter score is 6.0000.  So much for anonymous voting (I realize the commenter also told you what his vote would be). I thought you met the challenge theme well, by the way.  But you''re right, a 9 and a 10 is a bit high.  Is your mom voting?', '2010-01-27 13:50:51.000000', NULL, 0),
