(5838269, 848263, 14476, '<td valign="top"><b>GREETINGS FROM THE CRITIQUE CLUB</b> <br/> <br/>Dang it, when are we going to have another "Black &amp; White" challenge.  Your name will be up in lights!  (Delicately)<br/> <br/>Very, very lovely play on light in this image; one might almost say "a delicate play on light."   Unfortunately, I seem be one of the very few to say it.<br/> <br/>I''m not going to second-guess the voters;  as far as I''m concerned, this is technically and artistically just fine.  And meets the challenge about as well as ''most any of the entries. <br/> <br/>So keep on seeing the world your way and thanks for letting us enjoy it with you.</td>', 'GREETINGS FROM THE CRITIQUE CLUB  Dang it, when are we going to have another "Black & White" challenge.  Your name will be up in lights!  (Delicately) Very, very lovely play on light in this image; one might almost say "a delicate play on light."   Unfortunately, I seem be one of the very few to say it. I''m not going to second-guess the voters;  as far as I''m concerned, this is technically and artistically just fine.  And meets the challenge about as well as ''most any of the entries.  So keep on seeing the world your way and thanks for letting us enjoy it with you.', '2010-01-27 15:50:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(5838316, 847137, 61961, '<td valign="top">If it''s not too odd to say, "lovely work."  I''m not sure this is, as you say, something we can all relate to, though perhaps most of us can at least cringe at the topic.  Frankly I thought the blood put this into an extreme realm.  Powerful nonetheless.<br/> <br/>By the way, I love your color treatment.  Good comp, too, and I disagree with those who think the man should be less prominent.  I think your chosen DOF is right on.<br/> <br/></td>', 'If it''s not too odd to say, "lovely work."  I''m not sure this is, as you say, something we can all relate to, though perhaps most of us can at least cringe at the topic.  Frankly I thought the blood put this into an extreme realm.  Powerful nonetheless. By the way, I love your color treatment.  Good comp, too, and I disagree with those who think the man should be less prominent.  I think your chosen DOF is right on. ', '2010-01-27 16:10:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(5838319, 847794, 66384, '<td valign="top">I really like the tone, composition, and the DOF -- lovely bokeh. I agree it would benefit from sharper focus on the branches and drops. But still, it''s a very nice and delicate image.</td>', 'I really like the tone, composition, and the DOF -- lovely bokeh. I agree it would benefit from sharper focus on the branches and drops. But still, it''s a very nice and delicate image.', '2010-01-27 16:12:46.000000', NULL, 0),
