(5857489, 848212, 59029, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club!<br/> <br/>Oh my.  How do you critique such a lovely shot? *scratching head*  I really cannot find any flaws in this photo.  The feather cradles the water droplets beautifully, the composition really sets off the difference between the textures.  The lighting is perhaps a teeny bit on the orangey side, but otherwise...lovely.<br/> <br/>I''m sure <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=52549" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">IreneM</a> will be tremendously flattered upon learning that she is your inspiration.  Well done!<br/> <br/>Feel free to PM me with any questions,<br/> <br/>Susan</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club! Oh my.  How do you critique such a lovely shot? *scratching head*  I really cannot find any flaws in this photo.  The feather cradles the water droplets beautifully, the composition really sets off the difference between the textures.  The lighting is perhaps a teeny bit on the orangey side, but otherwise...lovely. I''m sure  IreneM will be tremendously flattered upon learning that she is your inspiration.  Well done! Feel free to PM me with any questions, Susan', '2010-02-07 20:55:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(5857906, 847471, 106543, '<td valign="top"><b>Greetings from the Critique Club! </b> <br/> <br/>Sorry about the wait for your critique, this is coming out of the backlog! <br/> <br/>I sure am a sucker for pictures of tigers! Not a fan of that plant in front of it''s face. The reason that you scored so low is that you didn''t really meet the challenge. Delicate is never a word to describe a tiger. Maybe a baby tiger but it doesn''t really fit in with a large mammal.<br/> <br/>Good luck in future challenges!<br/> <br/>If you have any questions <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/messaging.php?action=compose&amp;USER_ID=106543" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">click here to message me</a>! <br/> <br/>Senay</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club!   Sorry about the wait for your critique, this is coming out of the backlog!  I sure am a sucker for pictures of tigers! Not a fan of that plant in front of it''s face. The reason that you scored so low is that you didn''t really meet the challenge. Delicate is never a word to describe a tiger. Maybe a baby tiger but it doesn''t really fit in with a large mammal. Good luck in future challenges! If you have any questions click here to message me!  Senay', '2010-02-07 23:00:13.000000', NULL, 0),
