(6108056, 847412, 40718, '<td valign="top">Excellent choice to crop the top half of the girl off.  It heightens the tension of the image.  The rope is a great leading line between the two vertical pillars.  Our eye naturally stops at the ball and then either backs up or skips on to the girl''s legs.  This is a good example of where a serendipitous composition (you didn''t place the posts, ball, rope) really adds to the shot.  I''m enjoying your frequent choice of B&amp;W, which is something I lack in my own portfolio.  An excellent take on the exuberance (and fears) of youth.</td>', 'Excellent choice to crop the top half of the girl off.  It heightens the tension of the image.  The rope is a great leading line between the two vertical pillars.  Our eye naturally stops at the ball and then either backs up or skips on to the girl''s legs.  This is a good example of where a serendipitous composition (you didn''t place the posts, ball, rope) really adds to the shot.  I''m enjoying your frequent choice of B&W, which is something I lack in my own portfolio.  An excellent take on the exuberance (and fears) of youth.', '2010-07-28 22:17:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(6132838, 847867, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is so adorable.  Quite a story.</td>', 'This is so adorable.  Quite a story.', '2010-08-17 14:17:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(6170855, 847137, 97225, '<td valign="top">Wow! Judi. I have just come across this. It is such a powerful image. I think that the inclusion of the man gives us a dual focus which is entirely appropriate. We are appalled at the girl''s violation, and seethe with indignation at the man, who has simply turned his back and walked away from his evil act. He will go on with his life as though nothing has happened, while she must cope with something that will never leave her.</td>', 'Wow! Judi. I have just come across this. It is such a powerful image. I think that the inclusion of the man gives us a dual focus which is entirely appropriate. We are appalled at the girl''s violation, and seethe with indignation at the man, who has simply turned his back and walked away from his evil act. He will go on with his life as though nothing has happened, while she must cope with something that will never leave her.', '2010-09-24 02:20:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(6226219, 848100, 119747, '<td valign="top">One of my favourite drop pics, has a nice metallic feel to it.</td>', 'One of my favourite drop pics, has a nice metallic feel to it.', '2010-11-17 18:42:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(6340730, 848262, 24486, '<td valign="top">I''m stunned to see so many 1''s, 2''s &amp; 3''s &amp; worse, not a single comment to justify such a hammering. I rather like your lighting. Perhaps you could have tryed for a bit more detail in the womans face but I don''t know how you would have achieved that without going even higher than ISO 1600. I think you might have been a bit hard done by here.</td>', 'I''m stunned to see so many 1''s, 2''s & 3''s & worse, not a single comment to justify such a hammering. I rather like your lighting. Perhaps you could have tryed for a bit more detail in the womans face but I don''t know how you would have achieved that without going even higher than ISO 1600. I think you might have been a bit hard done by here.', '2011-03-04 01:26:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(6351477, 848020, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is breathtaking.</td>', 'This is breathtaking.', '2011-03-15 01:07:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(6776858, 848272, 49773, '<td valign="top">The placement of focus really made me stop and think, I think it''s in our brain to analyze photographs from left to right and from up to the bottom, so this came as a surprise. The blur nicely leads the eye to the focus point (I would expect something different to happen - you get hit by the focus and then slowly radiate away via blur, but this is even better).</td>', 'The placement of focus really made me stop and think, I think it''s in our brain to analyze photographs from left to right and from up to the bottom, so this came as a surprise. The blur nicely leads the eye to the focus point (I would expect something different to happen - you get hit by the focus and then slowly radiate away via blur, but this is even better).', '2012-05-23 19:31:25.000000', NULL, 0),
